+## Version 1.3.0
+
+* Date: 2022-09-12
+
+### Added
+
+* Data updates:
+  * MSigDB (August 2022.1)
+
+### Changed
+
+* Fixed some artefacts (`-AS1` entries) in the output of CancerMine
+* Added `approved_drugs` as a column to the `Drug associations` section
+of the output report
+
